[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":106},["ShallowReactive",2],{"/blog/tag/vite":3},[4],{"_path":5,"_dir":6,"_draft":7,"_partial":7,"_locale":8,"title":9,"description":10,"date":11,"tags":12,"excerpt":15,"body":25,"_type":100,"_id":101,"_source":102,"_file":103,"_stem":104,"_extension":105},"/blog/failed-to-resolve-entry","blog",false,"","Failed to resolve entry for package \"xxx\". The package may have incorrect main/module/exports specified in its package.json. [plugin vite:dep-scan]","Record an unexpected bug.","2025-02-23 20:11",[13,14],"vite","frontend",{"type":16,"children":17},"root",[18],{"type":19,"tag":20,"props":21,"children":22},"element","p",{},[23],{"type":24,"value":10},"text",{"type":16,"children":26,"toc":97},[27,31,41,71,84],{"type":19,"tag":20,"props":28,"children":29},{},[30],{"type":24,"value":10},{"type":19,"tag":20,"props":32,"children":33},{},[34],{"type":19,"tag":35,"props":36,"children":38},"a",{"href":37},"main-module-exports",[39],{"type":24,"value":40},"Recommonded: Quick Understanding of main, module, exports, and type:module in package.json",{"type":19,"tag":20,"props":42,"children":43},{},[44,46,53,55,61,63,69],{"type":24,"value":45},"This error means that the entry file of the package, such as \"index.js\", cannot be found, which is defined by the ",{"type":19,"tag":47,"props":48,"children":50},"code",{"className":49},[],[51],{"type":24,"value":52},"main",{"type":24,"value":54}," and ",{"type":19,"tag":47,"props":56,"children":58},{"className":57},[],[59],{"type":24,"value":60},"module",{"type":24,"value":62}," properties of ",{"type":19,"tag":47,"props":64,"children":66},{"className":65},[],[67],{"type":24,"value":68},"package.json",{"type":24,"value":70},".",{"type":19,"tag":20,"props":72,"children":73},{},[74,76,82],{"type":24,"value":75},"But I went in the wrong direction at the beginning. My project is a ",{"type":19,"tag":47,"props":77,"children":79},{"className":78},[],[80],{"type":24,"value":81},"monorepo",{"type":24,"value":83},", using pnpm workspace, and recently used the \"workspace:xxx\" protocol of pnpm. So I suspect that vite does not recognize the workspace protocol and cannot find the package. I tried to upgrade vite, but it didn't work.",{"type":19,"tag":20,"props":85,"children":86},{},[87,89,95],{"type":24,"value":88},"What was the final reason? Because I re-cloned the project, the package folder (dist) of the sub-project was gone, so vite could naturally find the library but not the entry file. Just re-execute the ",{"type":19,"tag":47,"props":90,"children":92},{"className":91},[],[93],{"type":24,"value":94},"build",{"type":24,"value":96}," command.",{"title":8,"searchDepth":98,"depth":98,"links":99},2,[],"markdown","content:blog:986.failed-to-resolve-entry.md","content","blog/986.failed-to-resolve-entry.md","blog/986.failed-to-resolve-entry","md",1760095629467]